  "details": "About 2 maybe 3 months ago VRChat changed the design of the URL playlist in unity. \n\nIF the playlist is large such as in the Karaoke Cafe (I'm the owner) It because to lag unity out. Causing massive delays of up to 5-10 seconds each url that is updated. \n\nThis is not a hardware issue. I'm changed 2 computers currently on i7 8700k, 1080, 16GB ddr4 3000mhz etc...\n\nThe old design didn't lag at all and would much rather have it back. Or at least optimise the new design a little bit to keep the lag to a minimum.\n\nThank you,\nLucifer MStar",
